{"lyrics":"[00:21.52]Liquor turnin' me into a mess, I can feel it burnin' in my chest\n[00:27.28]But I know it's only for the best, I know love comes wit' a catch\n[00:32.70]If I give you my heart, give it back, you threw my heart in the trash\n[00:38.48]I was lookin' for it, found in the trash can\n[00:41.60]Layin' right next to your last mans, how did that happen?\n[00:46.52]You think I'm gettin' high by choice? You think I'm gettin' drunk by choice? I have no choice\n[00:52.24]It's feelin' like I have no voice, this ain't real love, it's just a decoy\n[00:57.42]Tell your best friend, “Don't mention me, whore”, she ain't even seen me before\n[01:02.70]I need real love, I need real drugs, I need more\n[01:08.24]You could catch me at the devil's front door\n[01:10.74]What the fuck I gotta run for? Why the fuck I gotta gun for then?\n[01:15.72]Heartbreak, I can't afford it, I'm just tryna' pay my mom's mortgage\n[01:21.52]Let me count my commas, ain't tryna deal with the drama, save it for your mama\n[01:26.94]Waking up, thinkin' 'bout dollars, heartbreak in my ears, still tryna' holler\n[01:31.48]Liquor turnin' me into a mess, I can feel it burnin' in my chest\n[01:36.26]But I know it's only for the best, I know love comes wit' a catch\n[01:41.68]If I give you my heart, give it back, you threw my heart in the trash\n[01:47.46]I was lookin' for it, found in the trash can\n[01:50.58]Layin' right next to your last mans, how did that happen?\n[02:30.50]Let me count my commas, ain't tryna deal with the drama, save it for your mama\n[02:35.92]Waking up, thinkin' 'bout dollars, heartbreak in my ears, still tryna' holler\n[02:40.16]Liquor turnin' me into a mess, I can feel it burnin' in my chest\n[02:45.24]But I know it's only for the best, I know love comes wit' a catch\n[02:50.66]If I give you my heart, give it back, you threw my heart in the trash\n[02:56.46]I was lookin' for it, found in the trash can\n[02:59.56]Layin' right next to your last mans, how did that happen?\